WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.148 --> 00:00:02.749
- We are going to prank
my boyfriend this morning

00:00:02.749 --> 00:00:04.931
with 1,000 roses.

00:00:04.931 --> 00:00:06.417
They're going to be delivered,

00:00:06.417 --> 00:00:08.344
we're gonna foot him the
bill at the end, too.

00:00:08.344 --> 00:00:10.502
(rock music)

00:00:11.595 --> 00:00:13.290
- Davis and I have been
together for two years,

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:15.240
and we've never pranked each other before,

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.796
but he loves surprising me.

00:00:16.796 --> 00:00:20.209
So this is my opportunity to surprise him

00:00:20.209 --> 00:00:22.090
with the ultimate prank.

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:23.367
I'm taking Davis out to brunch,

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:24.946
and when we get back,

00:00:24.946 --> 00:00:27.407
there will be 1,000 roses delivered

00:00:27.407 --> 00:00:29.056
by actors that we've hired

00:00:29.056 --> 00:00:31.331
to deliver the flowers to my apartment.

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:33.049
So while Davis and I are at brunch,

00:00:33.049 --> 00:00:34.489
the crew is setting up cameras

00:00:34.489 --> 00:00:36.230
all over my apartment,

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:38.134
and then they're gonna
hide in my sister's room

00:00:38.134 --> 00:00:40.247
while the prank is happening.

00:00:40.247 --> 00:00:42.012
I have no idea how he's going to react,

00:00:42.012 --> 00:00:44.357
but please don't hate me!

00:00:46.841 --> 00:00:48.399
Hey, what's up?
- [Sister] Hey how are you?

00:00:48.399 --> 00:00:49.658
- [Davis] What's up?

00:00:49.658 --> 00:00:52.926
- [Sister] How's it going?
- [Lauren] Good.

00:00:52.926 --> 00:00:54.507
- We have 1,000 roses here

00:00:54.507 --> 00:00:57.316
and we're about to do an epic rose prank.

00:00:57.316 --> 00:00:58.742
(knocking on door)

00:00:59.697 --> 00:01:00.558
- Who's that?

00:01:00.558 --> 00:01:02.183
When I hear the knock on the door,

00:01:02.183 --> 00:01:04.853
I'm terrified because

00:01:04.853 --> 00:01:07.129
this is really happening.

00:01:07.129 --> 00:01:07.921
Hi!

00:01:08.887 --> 00:01:09.618
What's up?

00:01:09.618 --> 00:01:11.847
- I have a rose delivery for Lauren.

00:01:11.847 --> 00:01:12.822
- When Davis sees them,

00:01:12.822 --> 00:01:15.469
he has no idea what's going on.

00:01:15.469 --> 00:01:18.730
(laughs) That's me.

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:20.903
Cool, oh my God!

00:01:20.903 --> 00:01:22.837
Those are gorgeous. (laughs)

00:01:22.837 --> 00:01:23.917
Wow!

00:01:27.528 --> 00:01:29.143
He mentioned that he had a few surprises

00:01:29.143 --> 00:01:30.235
planned for Valentine's Day,

00:01:30.235 --> 00:01:32.299
so I'm gonna play into that.

00:01:32.998 --> 00:01:33.741
Did you?

00:01:33.741 --> 00:01:35.316
- I did not!

00:01:35.316 --> 00:01:36.540
- Yes you did!

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:38.815
- I do like surprises, but...

00:01:38.815 --> 00:01:40.208
- Is this Valentine's Day?

00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:41.392
- No, it's the seventh!

00:01:41.392 --> 00:01:44.155
- They keep bringing in
more and more flowers.

00:01:44.155 --> 00:01:46.593
I don't even think they'll
fit in my apartment.

00:01:46.593 --> 00:01:48.010
- You must be Davis, right?

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:49.386
Can I just get your signature?

00:01:50.657 --> 00:01:51.687
- For what?

00:01:51.687 --> 00:01:53.684
- Just the invoice?

00:01:53.684 --> 00:01:55.800
(laughter)

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:57.872
- It's 3,625.44.

00:01:57.872 --> 00:02:00.380
- When we told him how
much it was going to be,

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:04.164
I could just see the stress piling on.

00:02:04.164 --> 00:02:06.440
- I don't have 3,000
dollars to pay you for...

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:08.297
- It's 3,625.44.

00:02:08.297 --> 00:02:09.783
I don't wanna step on,

00:02:09.783 --> 00:02:11.455
if you guys have been
dating for two years, maybe,

00:02:11.455 --> 00:02:13.243
isn't she worth it?

00:02:13.243 --> 00:02:14.543
- Oh absolutely!

00:02:14.543 --> 00:02:15.844
She's worth far more than that!

00:02:15.844 --> 00:02:17.214
- You send them as a surprise--

00:02:17.214 --> 00:02:20.720
- There's an entire day of
surprises planned for the 14th.

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:22.577
This is not inclusive.

00:02:22.577 --> 00:02:25.108
- Can you say, just say for the record,

00:02:25.108 --> 00:02:26.223
"I'm not gonna pay for them?"

00:02:26.223 --> 00:02:28.800
Can you just turn around to
that camera that's right there?

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:31.284
And say, "I'm not gonna
pay for these roses?"

00:02:31.284 --> 00:02:32.794
Cause you just got pranked!

00:02:32.794 --> 00:02:35.206
(laughter)

00:02:36.021 --> 00:02:36.996
- Practical solution.

00:02:36.996 --> 00:02:39.666
- You don't have to spend
3,000 dollars. (laughs)

00:02:39.666 --> 00:02:41.106
He was such a good sport about it.

00:02:41.106 --> 00:02:42.987
- I've never seen anyone get that many

00:02:42.987 --> 00:02:45.819
flowers of any kind
delivered for anything.

00:02:45.819 --> 00:02:48.768
This might actually be the
first time I've been pranked.

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:50.092
- If we're gonna start a pranking thing

00:02:50.092 --> 00:02:51.160
in our relationship now,

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:52.646
I don't know where we can go from here.

00:02:52.646 --> 00:02:55.316
This is the top, we hit the top of pranks.

00:02:55.316 --> 00:02:57.636
(cheerful music)

